Date: Sun, 15 Feb 2026 23:32:12 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] WLANRTSYS-100494 : [WNC][LR72][CAS-41983-Q9Y8F2] AFC failed
 in BV certification lab -

Issue : hostapd_cli send_afc_request fail with AFCDUSA32 item and wlan4 interace was gone

RCA : There is no standard implementation to handle 6G AFC power mode
fallback to LPI mechanism

Fix : Implemented the new design which checks for the afc data
before switching mode and falls back to LPI if no valid data found in SP
power mode.

FIXUP to WLANRTSYS-83162 Ported afcd and composite mode changes from legacy hostapd
